# Local Supabase credentials.
# `.env.local` is the one actually used; the rest are covered so a stray
# `.env` or `.env.production` cannot be committed by accident. The example
# stays — it holds placeholders and is how anyone knows which vars exist.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

